### Saldo de una pieza
GET http://localhost:8000/parts/196/availability

### Kardex de una pieza
GET http://localhost:8000/parts/196/ledger

### Materiales de una orden
GET http://localhost:8000/work-orders/R060826000/materials

### Faltantes abiertos
GET http://localhost:8000/shortages

### Retirar una pieza
POST http://localhost:8000/issues
Content-Type: application/json

{"work_order_code": "R060826000", "part_id": 196, "location_id": 100, "quantity": 1, "issued_by": "prueba"}

### Conteo sin motivo (debe dar 422)
POST http://localhost:8000/counts
Content-Type: application/json

{"location_id": 100, "reason": "", "lines": [{"part_id": 196, "counted_quantity": 0}]}

### P5-1 Transferir a ubicación que no existe (debe dar 404)
POST http://localhost:8000/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{"part_id": 196, "from_location_id": 100, "to_location_id": 999, "quantity": 2}

### P5-2 Transferir a la misma ubicación (debe dar 422)
POST http://localhost:8000/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{"part_id": 196, "from_location_id": 100, "to_location_id": 100, "quantity": 2}

### P5-3 Conteo: en U-100 hay 5 de la pieza 196 (debe dar 201, delta -1)
POST http://localhost:8000/counts
Content-Type: application/json

{"location_id": 100, "reason": "Conteo físico", "lines": [{"part_id": 196, "counted_quantity": 5}]}

### P5-4 Sacar más de lo que hay (debe dar 409)
POST http://localhost:8000/issues
Content-Type: application/json

{"work_order_code": "R060826000", "part_id": 196, "location_id": 100, "quantity": 50, "issued_by": "pedro"}